@startuml
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif"

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Padding 30
    Margin 20
  }
}
</style>

skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceReferenceFontSize 18
skinparam arrowFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 17
skinparam participantFontSize 20
skinparam actorFontSize 20

skinparam maxMessageSize 380
skinparam wrapWidth 380
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontStyle bold

autonumber

actor "Traveler / Browser\n[Client Web App]" as B #EBF5FB
participant "Fastify 5 BFF API\n[Session Boundary]" as API #E8F8F5
database "PostgreSQL Database\n[app_security schema]" as DB #FEF9E7
participant "Directus 12.1.1\n[Identity Authority]" as DIR #F2F4F4

== Authorized API Request & Session Validation ==

B -> API: Request protected business resource\n(transmitting secure session cookie)
activate API

API -> API: Compute cryptographic digest\n<b>H = SHA-256(handle)</b>
API -> DB: Lookup active session record by digest H
activate DB
DB --> API: Return session record\n(ciphertexts, IV, tag, token expiration timestamp)
deactivate DB

== Silent Sliding Refresh & Atomic Session Rotation ==

opt Access Token Nearing Expiration (t_exp - t_current <= delta_skew)
    API -> API: Decrypt Refresh Token via <b>AES-256-GCM</b>
    API -> DIR: Request token renewal (POST /auth/refresh)
    activate DIR
    DIR --> API: Return fresh Directus tokens {access_token, refresh_token}
    deactivate DIR
    
    API -> API: Generate nextHandle (32-byte CSPRNG) & new random IV
    API -> API: Re-encrypt fresh tokens with <b>AES-256-GCM</b>
    
    API -> DB: Execute atomic session rotation update\n(Set nextHandle digest, retain parent digest H,\nincrement rotation counter)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: Session rotated atomically
    deactivate DB
    
    API -> API: Attach refreshed secure session cookie
end

== Upstream Request Fulfillment & Seamless Response ==

API -> API: Decrypt Access Token via <b>AES-256-GCM</b> & verify Tag
API -> DIR: Forward authorized query to upstream service\n(Internal Bearer token)
activate DIR
DIR --> API: Return authorized weather dataset
deactivate DIR

API --> B: HTTP 200 OK (Weather DTO)\n[+ Refreshed session cookie if rotated]
deactivate API

note over B, API #E8F8F5
  <b>Seamless User Experience:</b>
  Sliding refresh occurs transparently in background. The client is never logged out
  due to short-lived JWT expiration, and token rotation enforces forward secrecy.
end note

@enduml
